| 6. Itinerary View | `GET /trips/{id}` (with nested stops+activities) | Stops (5.5) |
| 7. City Search | `GET /cities` | Cities (5.1) |
| 8. Activity Search | `GET /cities/{id}/activities` | Activities (5.2) |
| 9. Budget & Cost Breakdown | `GET /trips/{id}/budget`, `GET /trips/{id}/budget/daily` | Budget (5.6, 5.7) |
| 10. Calendar/Timeline | `GET /trips/{id}/budget/daily` + `GET /trips/{id}` | Daily Costs (5.7), Stops (5.5) |
| 11. Shared/Public Itinerary | `GET /public/trips`, `GET /public/trips/{id}`, `POST /trips/{id}/copy` | Trips (5.4) |
| 12. User Profile/Settings | `GET/PATCH/DELETE /users/me` | Users (5.3) |
| 13. Admin Analytics | `GET /admin/analytics`, `GET /admin/users` | Analytics (5.9), Admin Users (5.10) |

